  "short_description": "<p>Discover the elegance of our <strong data-start=\"1804\" data-end=\"1829\">round MOP rattan tray</strong>, handmade in Vietnam from natural rattan and Mother of Pearl. Perfect for serving or decoration. Sustainable, stylish, and crafted by skilled artisans.</p>",
  "description": "<p data-start=\"256\" data-end=\"523\">This <strong data-start=\"261\" data-end=\"280\">MOP Rattan Tray</strong> is a beautiful combination of natural rattan weaving and <strong data-start=\"338\" data-end=\"369\">Mother of Pearl (MOP) inlay</strong>, handcrafted by skilled Vietnamese artisans. The tray features a <strong data-start=\"435\" data-end=\"450\">round shape</strong>, offering both elegance and durability for home serving or decoration.</p>\n<p data-start=\"525\" data-end=\"742\">Each piece is <strong data-start=\"539\" data-end=\"584\">handwoven from sustainably sourced rattan</strong> and meticulously <strong data-start=\"602\" data-end=\"645\">decorated with polished seashell inlays</strong>, reflecting a natural shimmer that enhances any interior style — from coastal to contemporary.</p>\n<p data-start=\"744\" data-end=\"912\">Made in traditional Vietnamese craft villages, this tray is not only a practical serving piece but also a work of art that showcases Vietnam’s rich cultural heritage.</p>\n<p data-start=\"914\" data-end=\"1065\">By purchasing our handcrafted trays, you support rural artisans and contribute to sustainable livelihoods while preserving traditional craftsmanship.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"1067\" data-end=\"1070\" />\n<h3 data-start=\"1072\" data-end=\"1095\"><strong data-start=\"1076\" data-end=\"1093\">Key Features:</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1096\" data-end=\"1346\">\n<li data-start=\"1096\" data-end=\"1150\">\n<p data-start=\"1098\" data-end=\"1150\">Material: Natural rattan and Mother of Pearl inlay</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1151\" data-end=\"1167\">\n<p data-start=\"1153\" data-end=\"1167\">Shape: Round</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1168\" data-end=\"1204\">\n<p data-start=\"1170\" data-end=\"1204\">Finish: Polished, smooth surface</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1205\" data-end=\"1245\">\n<p data-start=\"1207\" data-end=\"1245\">Handwoven and handcrafted in Vietnam</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1246\" data-end=\"1289\">\n<p data-start=\"1248\" data-end=\"1289\">Eco-friendly and sustainable production</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1290\" data-end=\"1346\">\n<p data-start=\"1292\" data-end=\"1346\">Ideal for serving, home decor, hotels, or gift shops</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr data-start=\"2131\" data-end=\"2134\" />\n<h3 data-start=\"2136\" data-end=\"2190\"><strong data-start=\"2140\" data-end=\"2188\">Additional Section (for your product posts):</strong></h3>\n<p data-start=\"2191\" data-end=\"2520\"><strong data-start=\"2191\" data-end=\"2230\">Supplier &amp; Manufacturer in Vietnam:</strong><br data-start=\"2230\" data-end=\"2233\" />We provide high-quality handmade rattan and Mother of Pearl trays from Vietnam, offering bulk and wholesale options for retailers, decorators, and hospitality projects.<br data-start=\"2401\" data-end=\"2404\" />For inquiries, please contact us at <strong data-start=\"2440\" data-end=\"2467\"><a class=\"decorated-link cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"2442\" data-end=\"2465\">vietcraft2006@gmail.com</a></strong> or visit <a class=\"decorated-link cursor-pointer\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"2477\" data-end=\"2517\">www.vietcraft.vn</a>.</p>",
